
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional Lore - House Vance.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional Lore - House Vance.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1pvlk25","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1776993483475,"size":2518,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"1pvlk25"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,17],"#Optional Lore - House Vance":[19,20],"#A prominent 'New Rich' house whose title and fortune were forged through generations of decorated service in the Floran Navy.":[21,30],"#A prominent 'New Rich' house whose title and fortune were forged through generations of decorated service in the Floran Navy.#{1}":[22,30]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":100,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["House Vance","Vance","Nora","naval family"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**House Vance (New Rich - Floran Navy)**\nA \"New Rich\" noble house that earned its title and wealth through generations of distinguished service in the Floran Navy. They value physical excellence, discipline, and competitive achievement, viewing a strong body and competitive spirit as the highest virtues.\n\n**When to select:** When Nora Vance is the POV character, when discussing New Rich vs. Old Money tensions, when military/athletic training is relevant, when Imperialist politics are in play, or when dueling/accomplishment is a plot point.\n\n**Key relationships:** Strong alliance with House Castor (Amber Isles), another New Rich naval family. Natural allies with the Imperialist faction. Their ethos contrasts with older landed aristocratic houses."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional Lore - House Vance.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"105cuni","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional Lore - House Vance.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,17],"size":938,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
